Spec: App Component

Purpose:
  Mount the application, own active filter state, and coordinate child components.

Structure:
  ./app.js: Root component implementation.

Owns:
  ./app.js

References:
  ../services/todo.sdd
  ./todo-form.sdd
  ./todo-list.sdd

Must:
  Accept a mount target DOM element.
  Instantiate @TodoService and wire child components to it through callbacks.
  Render @TodoForm, @TodoList, and filter controls.
  Update the displayed list when filter state changes.
  Re-render the list after every todo mutation.

Must not:
  Contain business logic.
  Perform todo CRUD outside of @TodoService.

Depends on:
  @TodoService
  @TodoForm
  @TodoList

Exposes:
  @App

Scenario: initial render
  Given the app is mounted
  Then the form, list, and filter controls are present in the DOM
  And all todos are displayed

Scenario: filter change
  Given the active filter changes to "active"
  Then only incomplete todos are displayed

Done when:
  App mounts without errors.
  Filter state is reflected in the rendered list.
  Child components receive updated data after each mutation.
